Canonical plans reference scheme in the Rust core[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]refs[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]refs: add the parse/render/resolve API for `plans:` references to the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Rust core, expose it through the PyO3 binding, and give the Python side [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]one root-resolution facade that also accepts every legacy path form.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Route every plan-reference resolver through the shared API[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]resolve[dim] · [dim][/dim]after refs[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]resolve: replace the five independent path-guessing implementations that[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]turn a stored reference into a file with calls into the shared resolver,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]so every surface agrees on what a reference means.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Persist plans references on new beads[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]write[dim] · [dim][/dim]after refs, resolve[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]write: make every writer of a bead's plan link emit the canonical [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`plans:` form, in both the Python epic-creation path and the Rust `bead [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]create` path.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Show the logical reference and its resolved path[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]display[dim] · [dim][/dim]after refs, resolve[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]display: render the stable reference together with where it currently [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]resolves, and say so plainly when it resolves nowhere, in `sase bead [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]show` and the ACE Plans tab.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Validate and repair stored plan links[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]doctor[dim] · [dim][/dim]after refs, resolve[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]doctor: make the health check actually check plan links, add an opt-in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]repair that rewrites legacy paths to canonical references using the plan[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`bead_id` reverse index, and migrate the live store.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-9z","hidden":false,"llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-9z.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-218668242ca29ec943471322e7c3426d","started_at":"2026-07-27T08:40:42.634751","state":"dismissed"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1785168229,"sha":"881636a745de9f88d43cbfcec868f6a537e9f0a2","subject":"feat(sdd): surface plan references and where they resolve (sase-9z.4)"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"b2b99c9876eec0586844cc5248675a0da32b252eabe4983dc0f473539c95f786","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-9z.4/commits.json","size_bytes":247},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-9z.4/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"35e1f2838f5b20e0c8346418eea9b8b4858120854ee4aadbb5841afc815ead71","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-9z.4/meta.json","size_bytes":600},"prompt":{"digest":"cf5a1b356d0b79bca0a53541df17d90169b8283a046e65357d038609914a4edc","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-9z.4/prompt.md","size_bytes":182},"state":{"digest":"27fb72a6887db94e5f744962f9bacf1d1e6f89b9dd5f8f0a99918c6e43bd824c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-9z.4/state.json","size_bytes":18